# Create PR

When creating or updating a GitHub pull request, follow `.cursor/skills/create-pr/SKILL.md`.

The description is always in French, with this section order: Ticket, Résumé, Preview Storybook, Tests, Accessibilité, Breaking changes. Do not use English headings such as Summary or Test plan. Title stays an English conventional commit.
